<%doc>

=head1 NAME

/decision_vote/vote.mas - public page of a variety vote of a decision meeting

=head1 DESCRIPTION

No login: the token of the personal link e-mailed to an invited person
identifies the voter (there is no public link). Ballot (a place for each
candidate, optional notes), progress of the vote (totals only) and, after the
end date, the anonymous results with the trait values and selection index of
the candidates.
Code: js/source/entries/decision_vote_public.js, data: /ajax/decision_vote/public/*.

=head1 AUTHOR

Chris Simoes <ccs263@cornell.edu>

=cut

</%doc>

<%args>
$token => ''
$kind => 'ballot'
</%args>

<& /util/import_javascript.mas, entries => ['decision_vote_public'] &>

<& /page/page_title.mas, title => 'Variety vote' &>

<style>
#dv_app { max-width: 900px; font-size: 15px; }
#dv_app .dv-box { border: 1px solid #d9dee5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 14px; margin: 0 0 14px 0; background: #fff; }
#dv_app .dv-muted { color: #6b7280; }
#dv_app .dv-progress-num { display: inline-block; min-width: 90px; text-align: center; margin: 0 10px 6px 0; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; background: #f5f7fa; }
#dv_app .dv-progress-num b { display: block; font-size: 22px; }
#dv_app .dv-item { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; background: #fafbfc; }
#dv_app .dv-main { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
#dv_app .dv-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; word-break: break-word; }
#dv_app .dv-item.dv-dup { border-color: #f0ad4e; background: #fcf8e3; }
#dv_app textarea.dv-comment { font-size: 14px; }
#dv_app .dv-field { margin-top: 6px; }
#dv_app .dv-field label { margin-bottom: 2px; }
#dv_app .dv-bar { height: 10px; background: #2b7a4b; border-radius: 3px; }
#dv_app .dv-bar-wrap { background: #eef2f0; border-radius: 3px; min-width: 80px; }
#dv_app .dv-link { font-family: monospace; word-break: break-all; background: #f5f7fa; padding: 8px; border-radius: 4px; }
#dv_app .dv-first td { background: #e8f3ec !important; }
#dv_app .dv-quote { border-left: 3px solid #d9dee5; padding-left: 8px; margin: 4px 0; color: #374151; }
</style>

<div id="dv_app" data-token="<% $token |h %>" data-kind="<% $kind |h %>">
  <div class="dv-muted"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-refresh"></span> Loading...</div>
</div>

<script>
  jQuery(function() { window.jsMod['decision_vote_public'].init(); });
</script>
